---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CallToAction from '@/components/CallToAction.astro';
import { contact } from '@/data/site';
interface Props { lang: 'en' | 'zh'; localized?: boolean }
const { lang, localized = false } = Astro.props;
const zh = lang === 'zh';
const prefix = localized ? `/${lang}` : '';
const poster = '/images/company/van-harvest-company-poster.webp';
const coverage = zh
  ? [
      { name: '北卡罗来纳州', sub: 'North Carolina' },
      { name: '南卡罗来纳州', sub: 'South Carolina' },
      { name: '亚特兰大', sub: 'Atlanta, Georgia' },
      { name: '维吉尼亚州', sub: 'Virginia' },
    ]
  : [
      { name: 'North Carolina', sub: 'Restaurant delivery coverage' },
      { name: 'South Carolina', sub: 'Restaurant delivery coverage' },
      { name: 'Atlanta, Georgia', sub: 'Regional delivery coverage' },
      { name: 'Virginia', sub: 'Regional delivery coverage' },
    ];
---
<BaseLayout title={zh ? '关于 Van Harvest | 夏洛特食品供应商' : 'About Van Harvest Distribution | Charlotte Food Supplier'} description={zh ? '成立于 2019 年，Van Harvest Distribution 以 Charlotte 为中心，为北卡、南卡及周边餐饮客户提供一站式食品批发与配送服务。' : 'Founded in 2019, Van Harvest Distribution is a Charlotte-based foodservice partner serving restaurant customers across the Carolinas and its regional delivery network.'} active="/company" lang={lang} ogImage={poster}>
  <section class="company-hero"><div class="shell company-hero-grid"><div class="company-hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">{zh ? '关于 Van Harvest' : 'About Van Harvest'}</p><h1>{zh ? <>从 Charlotte 出发，<br /><em>为餐馆而建。</em></> : <>Built in Charlotte.<br /><em>Built for restaurants.</em></>}</h1><p class="company-dek">{zh ? '成立于 2019 年，Van Harvest Distribution 以贴近餐馆运营节奏的食品供应、清晰的沟通和稳定配送为基础，为专业厨房提供可靠支持。' : 'Founded in 2019, Van Harvest Distribution was built around the pace of restaurant purchasing: dependable food supply, clear communication and delivery that keeps professional kitchens moving.'}</p></div><figure class="company-hero-poster"><img src={poster} alt={zh ? 'Van Harvest Delivery 公司海报，展示仓库与配送车辆' : 'Van Harvest Delivery company poster featuring its warehouse and delivery truck'} loading="eager" /><figcaption>{zh ? '来自 Van Harvest 的公司介绍海报' : 'A Van Harvest company introduction poster'}</figcaption></figure></div></section>

  <section class="company-reading"><div class="shell company-reading-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">{zh ? '我们的故事' : 'Our story'}</p><h2>{zh ? <>把采购的复杂，<br /><em>变成可靠日常。</em></> : <>Making procurement<br /><em>more dependable.</em></>}</h2></div><div class="company-prose"><p>{zh ? '从成立之初，Van Harvest 就专注于服务 Charlotte 及北卡、南卡地区餐馆的日常采购。餐饮采购不是单次交易，而是每天都要准时发生的协作：新鲜食材要及时到货，冷冻与常温产品要整齐衔接，厨房需要在高峰之前把货备齐。我们围绕这个节奏建立起食品、餐饮用品和区域配送相结合的服务方式。' : 'From the beginning, Van Harvest has focused on the everyday purchasing needs of restaurant customers in Charlotte and across North and South Carolina. Foodservice purchasing is not a one-time transaction—it is a daily coordination problem. Fresh ingredients must arrive on time, frozen and dry goods must stay connected to the order, and kitchens need stock in place before the rush. Our operation is designed around that rhythm.'}</p><p>{zh ? '今天，29,000 平方英尺的仓储基础、冷链产品能力和从蛋白、蔬果、海鲜到米面、调味品及餐饮用品的广泛品类，帮助客户把更多采购集中在一个熟悉的本地伙伴身上。对于中餐馆、亚洲餐饮、超市和便利店，我们理解产品名称、包装习惯与季节性需求同样重要。' : 'Today, a 29,000-square-foot warehouse foundation, cold-chain capable assortment and broad selection—from proteins, produce and seafood to rice, noodles, seasonings and restaurant supplies—help customers bring more of their purchasing through one familiar local partner. For Chinese restaurants, Asian foodservice teams, supermarkets and convenience stores, product familiarity, pack formats and seasonal demand matter as much as selection.'}</p><p>{zh ? '我们的目标很直接：用更清楚的目录、更顺畅的销售沟通和更稳定的区域配送，让厨房团队把时间花在客人和菜品上，而不是不停追问货源。' : 'The goal is straightforward: use a clearer catalog, responsive sales communication and reliable regional delivery so kitchen teams can spend more time on guests and menus—not chasing product sources.'}</p></div></div></section>

  <section class="company-network"><div class="shell"><div class="company-network-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">{zh ? '配送网络' : 'Delivery network'}</p><h2>{zh ? <>从 Charlotte，<br /><em>连接专业厨房。</em></> : <>From Charlotte,<br /><em>to the kitchen.</em></>}</h2></div><p>{zh ? '以 Charlotte 仓储与办公室为协同中心，Van Harvest 目前服务北卡、南卡、亚特兰大及维吉尼亚的餐饮客户。具体配送日、截单时间和最低起送额将根据客户地址由团队确认。' : 'Charlotte warehousing and office operations coordinate the current network serving restaurant customers in North Carolina, South Carolina, Atlanta and Virginia. Delivery days, cutoffs and minimums are confirmed by the team for each address.'}</p></div><div class="network-plot" role="img" aria-label={zh ? 'Van Harvest 配送网络：Charlotte 连接北卡、南卡、亚特兰大和维吉尼亚' : 'Van Harvest delivery network: Charlotte connects to North Carolina, South Carolina, Atlanta and Virginia'}><div class="network-origin"><span>{zh ? '运营中心' : 'Operations hub'}</span><strong>Charlotte, NC</strong><small>{zh ? '29,000 SF 仓储与办公室' : '29,000 SF warehouse & office'}</small></div><div class="network-lines" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="network-destinations">{coverage.map((place) => <article class="network-node"><strong>{place.name}</strong><span>{place.sub}</span></article>)}</div></div></div></section>
<section class="company-poster-story"><div class="shell company-poster-grid"><div class="company-poster-copy"><p class="eyebrow">{zh ? '餐馆优先的服务方式' : 'A restaurant-first way of working'}</p><h2>{zh ? <>新鲜、冷链、<br /><em>一站式采购。</em></> : <>Fresh, cold-chain,<br /><em>one local source.</em></>}</h2><p>{zh ? '从活海鲜与水产，到开胃菜、肉类冻品、米面粮油和餐饮用品，Van Harvest 将多种厨房所需集中在一个供应关系中。客户可从产品目录开始，也可以直接通过销售与办公室团队讨论更适合自己的订货方式。' : 'From live seafood and aquatic products to appetizers, meat and frozen goods, rice, noodles, cooking oils and foodservice supplies, Van Harvest brings kitchen needs into one supply relationship. Customers can begin with the catalog or speak directly with the sales and office teams about the order flow that fits their operation.'}</p><a class="text-link" href={`${prefix}/products/`}>{zh ? '浏览产品分类 →' : 'Explore departments →'}</a></div><div class="company-poster-quote"><p>{zh ? '“万家餐饮源，客户生意昌。”' : '“Built to keep restaurant business moving.”'}</p><span>{zh ? `Charlotte 办公室 · ${contact.phoneDisplay}` : `Charlotte office · ${contact.phoneDisplay}`}</span></div></div></section>
  <CallToAction lang={lang} localized={localized} />
</BaseLayout>
